#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. いつになっても、これに慣れる事はない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... I just don't think I'll ever\n"
"get used to it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>見張られる事に慣れるなんて…ありえない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, who could get used to being watched 24/7?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
